Package: ec-su-axb35-linux
Version: 1.1-1
Section: hardware
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Pirate85 <Pirate85@web.de>
Depends: dkms, linux-headers-generic (>= 6.0), python3-tk, smartmontools, systemd
Recommends: openssl
Description: Fan control driver + system monitor for Sixunited AXB35-02 EC
 Kernel module and all-in-one GUI for fan control on AMD Strix Halo
 mini PCs with the Sixunited AXB35-02 embedded controller board.
 .
 Compatible hardware: GMKtec EVO-X2, Bosgame M5, FEVM FA-EX9,
 Peladn YO1, NIMO AI MiniPC, Corsair AI Workstation 300.
 .
 Features: DKMS kernel module (auto-rebuild on kernel updates),
 live system monitor (CPU/GPU/NVMe/RAM/VRAM/fans), fan curve
 configuration GUI with persistence via systemd service.
